OL,3,GNEWSA'Our newborn baby nearly died from
OL,4,AGroup B Strep'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura and Matt welcomed their first
OL,7,Fchild in February but at just three
OL,8,Fweeks old he suddenly became seriously
OL,9,Funwell.
OL,11,FLeo was floppy and lethargic so
OL,12,Finstinctively the couple rushed him to
OL,13,FUniversity Hospital Southampton (UHS)
OL,14,Fwhere he was found to have sepsis and
OL,15,Fmeningitis caused by Group B
OL,16,FStreptococcus (GBS).
OL,18,F"The neurologist and all the
OL,19,Fspecialists sat us down and said they
OL,20,Fdidn't think that Leo was going to
OL,21,Fsurvive," the Southampton couple said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
