OL,3,GNEWSA'Our newborn baby nearly died from
OL,4,AGroup B Strep'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGBS is common type of bacteria carried
OL,7,Fharmlessly by about one-in-four women,
OL,8,Fbut it can be passed to babies during
OL,9,Fchildbirth and can cause
OL,10,Flife-threatening infections.
